{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LAQAxuP88QVwSiMaXAhNMV","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-21\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- register_100_cf（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp013_nli_validation** (success): NLI gate (DeBERTa-v3-large, threshold 0.90) decisions are reliable proxies for human content-preservation judgments, achieving Cohen's kappa >= 0.6 with LLM-as-annotator (Qwen3-32B)\\\\n- **exp-013** (killed): NLI gate (DeBERTa-v3-large, threshold 0.90) decisions are reliable proxies for human content-preservation judgments, achieving Cohen's kappa >= 0.6 with LLM-as-annotator (Qwen3-32B)\\\\n  [exp013_nli_validation](/api/workspace-files/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/artifacts/exp-013/data/exp013_nli_validation_summary.txt)\\\\n- **verbosity_32b** (negative): Verbosity axis (verbose/concise) produces stronger style bias signal than formality in GPT-4o judge: pairwise win rate ≥60% with p<0.05 and/or Likert corrected ATE with d≥0.3, because verbose responses contain more surface-level detail that judges may conflate with thoroughness ← 基于 pairwise_32b\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 6 / 负向 5 / 失败 0 / 共 12\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-29275: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp-013: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1145, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G7YS3sTMGjm7udXT7ewmrx","session_id":"f191c373-9bcf-4685-a04d-b4374a1ca49f","uuid":"90c690ba-16f2-4c03-b9c8-ed3bb821a54e","timestamp":"2026-05-21T01:41:30.268Z"}
